  "description": "Xwayland is an X server for running X clients under Wayland.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * xorg: X11: xserver: X.org: glamor Font Atlas Heap Buffer Overflow (CVE-2026-55999)\n  * X.org: xorg-x11-server: GLX contextTags Use-After-Free in CommonMakeCurrent() (CVE-2026-56000)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
